      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Railroads crisscrossed the town, with the Mississippi River and Bonne Terre line built in 1890 to ship ore to smelters in Herculaneum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
